      "id": "legacy-hook",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Hooks.php:51 OCP\\Versions::preDelete: the manual names no replacement event"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 connection to a legacy hook of the server. A hook the server removed is never emitted, and the listener never runs; the typed events of OCP\\EventDispatcher replace the hooks.",
        "OCP\\Util::connectHook() is deprecated since Nextcloud 21: use \\OCP\\EventDispatcher\\IEventDispatcher::addListener. ocp-deprecated leaves these calls to this finding.",
        "  lib/Hooks.php:51 OCP\\Versions::preDelete: the manual names no replacement event"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "template-inline-script",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "templates/editor.php:63 <script> with content"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 inline script in templates/. The Content Security Policy of the server runs neither a <script> without a source or the nonce of the response nor an event handler attribute, so the browser does not run them. A script added with OCP\\Util::addScript() or addInitScript() runs.",
        "  templates/editor.php:63 <script> with content"
      ]
    },
